              "path": ["doctors","me"]
            },
            "description": "Returns the authenticated doctor's full profile: name, title, email, phone, location, licenseNumber, experience, specialization, languages, bio. Also includes quickStats: totalPatients, assessmentsDone, avgRating, yearsExperience."
